{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38527","headline":"宪丞裴公上洛退居有寄二首 二 · 吴融","name":"宪丞裴公上洛退居有寄二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘦如仙鹤爽风篁，外却尘嚣兴绪长。\n偶坐几回沈皓月，闲吟是处到残阳。\n门前立使修书嬾，花下留宾压酒忙。\n目断琼林攀不得，一重丹水抵三湘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}